      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAVEN'S CALL (2) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 34.93 beating DEL AMITRI. Great chance again. DEL AMITRI (8) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 1.5 lengths second (35.02) behind RAVEN'S CALL at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to his credit. Well-placed to take this out. CALLISTA (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Warragul behind Hypnotizing (26.39) in a T3 RSTW. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to be in this for a long way. URUGUAYAN GIRL (3) deserves plenty of thought at her first run at this distance.",
